","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31881,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"万州守潘拉登鲁池观荷花荔枝 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"分随猿鹤老隈支，趋诏重来两鬓丝。\n解后一觞莫辞凸，能禁二十载差池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31882,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"万州守潘拉登鲁池观荷花荔枝 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"密林和雨剪离支，曲径留阴切藕丝。\n自入渝涪山色恶，眼明见此鲁家池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31883,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三峡桥","author":"魏了翁","text":"英云皓雨泻明蠲，题作人间第六泉。\n拟把谷帘从黜降，却将此水为超迁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31884,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"于眉州挽诗 其一","author":"魏了翁","text":"士为谋身蛇有足，人于嚣讼鼠无牙。\n狱书一落于公手，不识从来豪大家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31885,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"于眉州挽诗 其二","author":"魏了翁","text":"南浦冬阴翻手雨，湓江春涨打头风。\n乖逢命耳吾何戚，赢得三州桃李丛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31886,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"于眉州挽诗 其三","author":"魏了翁","text":"老雁长云横蜀道，归鸦落日倚江城。\n摩挲少日生祠记，忍听虞歌薤露声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","com